  "_comment": [
    "Source map: ComfyUI model filename -> where to download it from.",
    "Used by fetch-missing-models.sh, which reads the *_name inputs out of every",
    "bundle's workflow.json and looks each referenced file up here. Keys are the",
    "filename exactly as the workflow.json asks for it; `path` is the path inside",
    "the Hugging Face repo, which may have a different basename (the file is saved",
    "under the key, so an upstream rename is fine).",
    "`dir` is the subdirectory under ComfyUI's models/ the loader expects.",
    "`gated` means the repo requires accepting a licence: export HF_TOKEN=hf_...",
    "Verified against upstream 2026-07-29. If a URL 404s, the repo was",
    "re-organised: search huggingface.co for the filename and fix the entry."
